Description: A collection of statistical functions for use in MATH 4753,
    including maximum likelihood estimation (MLE) for beta distributions,
    overbooking simulations using discrete and normal approximations,
    bootstrap confidence intervals, and a generic likelihood maximization plotter.
    Includes an environmental dataset on MTBE contamination for analysis.
